			"notes": "## Highlights\n- Adds custom picture frames with in-game image import, cropping, and linked multi-frame displays.\n- Supports PNG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, TIFF, and WBMP images, animated GIFs, and H.264 MP4 video.\n- Improves video playback by reusing frame buffers and raising the output cap to about 30 FPS.\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.1\n- Fabric Loader and Fabric API\n- Java 21\n\n## Install\nDownload `picturewall-1.5.5.jar` below and place it in your Minecraft `mods` folder."
